|## Final check
|
|- Finding 1 — resolved. instructionStartIndex is included in
+composition/cache state, revealed instruction boxes are copied from
+their actual canonical location, and the outer loop stabilizes against
+both offset and source index. The prior reproduction no longer shows
+mismatched panel geometry or duplicated narrow instruction rows. The
+regression test covers it.
|
